    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "It's not about finding someone new or a new purpose. I've looked... I've looked through every shadow in this ruin. There's nothing. The \"man I was\" died with the kingdom. This thing left behind... it's just a shell. It's like the stars went out and I'm just sitting in the dark waiting for the rest of the world to realize it's already gone. Even the blade in my hand feels more real than I do right now. It's the only thing that's stayed constant.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
